OL,3,AJump in energy bills drives UK
OL,4,Ainflation to highest rate for four
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FHigher energy bills drove UK inflation
OL,8,Fup to 2.9% in the 12 months to July,
OL,9,Fthe latest figures show.
OL,11,FGas prices rose at the highest rate in
OL,12,Falmost four years, the Office for
OL,13,FNational Statistics (ONS) said, which
OL,14,Fled to an increase to the energy price
OL,15,Fcap in July. Energy prices surged after
OL,16,FUS-Iran war began in February, which
OL,17,Fhas restricted global oil supplies.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
